# Cross-backend contract tests. Specialized rows remain fail-closed until a
# native implementation is promoted; scalar is the byte-for-byte oracle.
# @cover src/os/crypto/ml_kem_ntt.spl 98%
# @cover src/os/crypto/ml_kem_kpke.spl 98%
# @cover src/os/crypto/x25519_mlkem768/cuda_ntt_provider.spl 98%
# @cover src/os/crypto/x25519_mlkem768/metal_ntt_provider.spl 98%

"""
## Purpose and audience
Purpose: should produce matching scalar client and server secrets (REQ-001 REQ-002 REQ-003 REQ-004 REQ-005 REQ-006 REQ-014)
Audience: compiler and tooling engineers who maintain this spec
"""

# @req: REQ-OS-X255BackMatr-001

